stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> Closed: enabled via circuitBreaker

    state "Closed (counting failures)" as Closed
    state "Open (fast-fail)" as Open
    state "Half-open (probe)" as HalfOpen

    Closed --> Closed: success, 4xx, or in-flight abort resets the streak
    Closed --> Open: threshold consecutive availability failures

    Open --> Open: every request throws CIRCUIT_OPEN_ERROR
    Open --> HalfOpen: cooldownMs elapsed since the last failure

    HalfOpen --> Closed: probe succeeds, onCircuitClose
    HalfOpen --> Closed: 4xx, envelope error, or abort closes the breaker
    HalfOpen --> Open: availability failure reopens, cooldown doubles up to 8x
